# This fork is Tor-only: container/docker-compose.yml runs the Tor stack of
# torxng/docker-compose.yml, which reads its variables from torxng/.env, NOT
# from this directory. Copy torxng/.env.example to torxng/.env instead:
#
#   SEARXNG_SECRET   required, server.secret_key (e.g. openssl rand -hex 32)
#   SEARXNG_PORT     published port, always bound to 127.0.0.1 (default 8080)
#
# See torxng/README.md, "Prerequisites and quick start".
